WEBVTT

00:00:01.165 --> 00:00:06.035
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:07.075 --> 00:00:12.415
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:24.055 --> 00:00:29.395
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:30.135 --> 00:00:34.835
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:36.005 --> 00:00:41.275
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.805 --> 00:00:46.945
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:47.345 --> 00:00:50.875
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.955 --> 00:00:56.045
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.695 --> 00:01:01.185
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.765 --> 00:01:08.725
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.805 --> 00:01:14.705
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tsuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.775 --> 00:01:21.335
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.615 --> 00:01:27.555
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:47.205 --> 00:01:48.435
If you've been hurt...

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.145
During battle...

00:01:50.675 --> 00:01:51.875
We'll heal you all!

00:01:53.345 --> 00:01:54.435
We are...

00:01:55.285 --> 00:01:56.255
Huh?

00:01:57.485 --> 00:01:58.885
Wait, this...

00:01:59.425 --> 00:02:00.645
Retreat!

00:02:02.325 --> 00:02:03.685
I'm dead!

00:02:04.025 --> 00:02:05.615
Hideyo!

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:17.405
Hey!

00:02:17.705 --> 00:02:19.295
How was your debut?

00:02:19.675 --> 00:02:22.145
We need to go home
and reevaluate.

00:02:22.205 --> 00:02:23.175
What?

00:02:24.315 --> 00:02:26.645
I'm sorry, I...

00:02:27.045 --> 00:02:28.745
It's not your fault!

00:02:29.355 --> 00:02:31.945
We need to fundamentally
rethink this.

00:02:32.525 --> 00:02:33.955
Fundamentally?

00:02:34.455 --> 00:02:37.155
I think you might be
misunderstanding something.

00:02:38.755 --> 00:02:42.695
We thought of a catchphrase
like you told us to, and...

00:02:42.765 --> 00:02:44.125
Sorry guys.

00:02:44.335 --> 00:02:45.995
I'll visit you
at your home later.

00:02:57.215 --> 00:02:58.505
What is this?

00:03:12.595 --> 00:03:13.565
Master Yata!

00:03:16.565 --> 00:03:18.695
So, the second one
has been awakened.

00:03:19.505 --> 00:03:21.225
Give me this PC's specs.

00:03:21.305 --> 00:03:22.295
Yes.

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.835
Hm... Like this?

00:03:25.235 --> 00:03:27.675
I think it would be better...

00:03:27.745 --> 00:03:30.715
...like this,
with your arm out diagonally.

00:03:31.015 --> 00:03:32.575
And I do this?

00:03:33.985 --> 00:03:36.145
You're in the middle...

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:39.615
...so I think it would be better
if you kept it symmetrical.

00:03:40.155 --> 00:03:41.745
Symmetrical?

00:03:41.825 --> 00:03:43.445
Same on the left and right.

00:03:44.095 --> 00:03:45.855
So, like this?

00:03:47.395 --> 00:03:48.765
Look at you guys!

00:03:49.795 --> 00:03:52.525
It works during practice.

00:03:52.605 --> 00:03:54.765
But it was a total mess
in the field.

00:03:56.375 --> 00:03:57.965
Wait a second.

00:03:58.035 --> 00:04:00.305
What level are you guys at?

00:04:00.675 --> 00:04:03.235
Hideyo just started...

00:04:03.315 --> 00:04:06.045
...and lately my role is to heal.

00:04:06.585 --> 00:04:07.565
Yeah.

00:04:07.645 --> 00:04:10.585
We have no choice but to
be at a lower level.

00:04:10.785 --> 00:04:12.755
What do you mean
you have no choice?!

00:04:12.825 --> 00:04:14.875
Go out and raise your levels!

00:04:14.955 --> 00:04:16.715
Nothing starts
until that happens!

00:04:16.855 --> 00:04:17.885
What?

00:04:18.255 --> 00:04:23.425
How do you expect to help adults
with the strength of a three year old?

00:04:24.595 --> 00:04:26.085
We're going now!

00:04:43.385 --> 00:04:46.215
What was that?

00:04:52.825 --> 00:04:54.195
Do you have a second?

00:04:55.565 --> 00:04:59.895
Are you struggling because
you're confused about your PC?

00:05:00.635 --> 00:05:02.435
Who are you?

00:05:03.735 --> 00:05:05.005
One who understands.

00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:10.515
Your character is a dangerous
PC body that can cause trouble...

00:05:10.575 --> 00:05:12.475
...involving those around you.

00:05:13.045 --> 00:05:16.145
I just came to warn you about that.

00:05:16.885 --> 00:05:17.975
Warn?

00:05:18.315 --> 00:05:20.285
Actually, to persuade you.

00:05:20.525 --> 00:05:22.455
Would you like to
join our guild?

00:05:22.525 --> 00:05:23.585
What?

00:05:23.655 --> 00:05:26.145
If you don't want to involve
any one else...

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:28.495
...you should
leave your current guild.

00:05:30.095 --> 00:05:31.995
Is it that bad?

00:05:32.605 --> 00:05:35.505
There's no telling when
what just happened will occur again.

00:05:39.575 --> 00:05:41.475
Here's my member address.

00:05:44.315 --> 00:05:47.805
Contact me when you've decided
what you're going to do.

00:06:07.605 --> 00:06:10.695
What are you doing being
a Reservoir Dog in this game?

00:06:11.035 --> 00:06:12.835
What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:12.905 --> 00:06:15.035
You're a stray dog.

00:06:17.645 --> 00:06:20.375
Isn't there something
you want to talk about?

00:06:24.755 --> 00:06:27.155
Why don't you just
let things be for now?

00:06:28.425 --> 00:06:30.485
Tri-Edge has disappeared.

00:06:30.695 --> 00:06:33.885
You should let the hospital
handle the rest.

00:06:34.125 --> 00:06:35.495
It doesn't matter.

00:06:36.035 --> 00:06:38.795
I still need to meet Tri-Edge.

00:06:39.635 --> 00:06:42.725
Even if you meet him,
you won't be able to talk to him.

00:06:42.805 --> 00:06:44.565
That's what I think.

00:06:47.305 --> 00:06:52.405
You lost to that player who
got away from Tri-Edge, right?

00:06:53.885 --> 00:06:55.315
It was a lack of motive.

00:06:55.385 --> 00:06:56.345
Oh?

00:06:56.815 --> 00:07:00.115
I really don't care
if I win or lose to her.

00:07:00.955 --> 00:07:03.185
My enemy is Tri-Edge.

00:07:03.255 --> 00:07:04.345
Only him.

00:07:06.565 --> 00:07:09.255
That's a pitiful excuse.

00:07:10.265 --> 00:07:12.785
If I can pin Tri-Edge down...

00:07:12.865 --> 00:07:14.595
...then I don't care about the rest.

00:07:15.875 --> 00:07:16.895
Fine.

00:07:17.805 --> 00:07:19.605
Just for the sake
of this discussion...

00:07:19.675 --> 00:07:23.265
...let's say you manage to pin down
Tri-Edge with your strength.

00:07:23.915 --> 00:07:26.275
Will he tell you
what you want to hear?

00:07:26.645 --> 00:07:30.175
If he doesn't comply,
I'll pursue him until he answers me.

00:07:30.415 --> 00:07:35.185
And what if the answer is not
what you wanted?

00:07:37.025 --> 00:07:39.045
You're dangerous right now.

00:07:40.295 --> 00:07:42.095
What do you mean "dangerous"?

00:07:42.395 --> 00:07:45.225
If your eyes are only
on one thing...

00:07:45.295 --> 00:07:49.205
...when something else happens
you won't be able to deal with it.

00:07:50.835 --> 00:07:53.175
That's what I mean
by "dangerous".

00:07:53.775 --> 00:07:55.175
Something else?

00:07:56.015 --> 00:07:58.475
There's no such thing.

00:07:58.545 --> 00:08:01.075
That's exactly
what I'm talking about.

00:08:01.215 --> 00:08:02.275
Enough!

00:08:17.265 --> 00:08:18.665
Oh, you know what?

00:08:18.935 --> 00:08:19.995
Huh?

00:08:20.105 --> 00:08:21.865
- Do you...
- What?

00:08:21.935 --> 00:08:23.335
...really like those?

00:08:23.505 --> 00:08:29.275
He admires the guild master of
this Twilight Brigade or whatever.

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:32.105
That's why he's wearing
the same goggles.

00:08:32.315 --> 00:08:34.045
You didn't have to tell her that.

00:08:34.715 --> 00:08:37.305
Ovan didn't wear goggles.

00:08:37.385 --> 00:08:40.045
He wore sunglasses.
Red ones.

00:08:42.925 --> 00:08:44.395
Should I take them off?

00:08:45.195 --> 00:08:46.315
No.

00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:48.595
Don't worry about it.

00:09:07.745 --> 00:09:08.945
It's Kuhn!

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:12.145
Hey, you're here!

00:09:12.485 --> 00:09:14.115
Can we go
somewhere today, too?

00:09:14.185 --> 00:09:16.345
Yeah, definitely!

00:09:16.525 --> 00:09:17.825
Anywhere you want!

00:09:18.255 --> 00:09:20.155
As long as
you're with us...

00:09:20.225 --> 00:09:22.215
...we don't mind where we go!

00:09:27.605 --> 00:09:29.465
Are you tired?

00:09:30.005 --> 00:09:31.665
No. Not at all.

00:09:31.975 --> 00:09:33.735
Then, let's do something!

00:09:34.545 --> 00:09:37.565
All right,
let's go raise your levels!

00:09:38.715 --> 00:09:39.335
Okay!

00:09:39.415 --> 00:09:40.475
Yay!

00:10:00.165 --> 00:10:01.635
Tabby, watch out!

00:10:05.605 --> 00:10:06.765
Oh, no...

00:10:07.245 --> 00:10:08.975
But I won't give up!

00:10:14.945 --> 00:10:17.745
If I don't give up,
everything will be okay!

00:10:21.755 --> 00:10:22.725
Huh?

00:10:28.395 --> 00:10:29.795
Thank you very much!

00:10:30.065 --> 00:10:31.365
That was a big help!

00:10:31.595 --> 00:10:33.425
It was nothing!

00:10:34.005 --> 00:10:36.065
So, what are you doing?

00:10:36.205 --> 00:10:38.765
Trying to raise our levels.
What about you?

00:10:38.835 --> 00:10:39.935
The same.

00:10:40.005 --> 00:10:42.165
But don't you think this place
is too tough?

00:10:42.245 --> 00:10:44.075
Well, yeah...

00:10:44.345 --> 00:10:47.905
It's inefficient if you're not
in the appropriate field.

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:51.515
Are those guys beginners?

00:10:51.585 --> 00:10:54.615
Yeah, pretty much.

00:10:55.125 --> 00:10:57.185
They're members of my guild.

00:10:57.255 --> 00:10:58.455
Yours?

00:10:58.655 --> 00:11:01.155
You created a guild?

00:11:01.525 --> 00:11:02.465
Yeah!

00:11:02.525 --> 00:11:04.395
It's called the
Paw Pad Squadron.

00:11:04.465 --> 00:11:07.025
It's a guild that heals others
from the sidelines.

00:11:08.135 --> 00:11:10.105
Sounds like a tough guild.

00:11:10.475 --> 00:11:12.565
There are a lot of PKs
in this game.

00:11:13.205 --> 00:11:16.735
That's exactly why
I thought it was needed.

00:11:31.825 --> 00:11:33.585
About the awakened one...

00:11:33.965 --> 00:11:36.455
It's going to take
a bit more time.

00:11:37.195 --> 00:11:38.255
I see.

00:11:38.465 --> 00:11:41.335
But I think he'll definitely
come here.

00:11:41.405 --> 00:11:43.335
There's no need to rush.

00:11:56.685 --> 00:12:02.055
The Twilight Brigade
used to gather here often.

00:12:03.355 --> 00:12:04.655
Really?

00:12:05.395 --> 00:12:07.455
We just need to do
our best, right?

00:12:07.825 --> 00:12:09.595
Aren't you worried?

00:12:09.665 --> 00:12:10.725
Not at all!

00:12:11.735 --> 00:12:14.365
Where there's a will,
there's a way, right?

00:12:15.705 --> 00:12:18.065
My sister says the same thing.

00:12:18.775 --> 00:12:20.205
Your sister?

00:12:20.275 --> 00:12:21.765
In the real world?

00:12:22.845 --> 00:12:25.175
We don't really
get along, though.

00:12:26.845 --> 00:12:30.805
Well, that kind of applies
to my whole family.

00:12:31.215 --> 00:12:33.015
Family, huh?

00:12:33.985 --> 00:12:36.585
I think it's pretty
similar everywhere.

00:12:37.325 --> 00:12:39.845
Your family doesn't
get along, either?

00:12:40.095 --> 00:12:41.755
Yeah, well...

00:12:41.825 --> 00:12:43.385
More or less.

00:12:44.235 --> 00:12:46.995
A family that gets along
sounds nice.

00:12:48.435 --> 00:12:49.955
I admire that.

00:12:51.805 --> 00:12:54.675
Oh, what am I talking about?

00:13:02.245 --> 00:13:04.475
This place is amazing!

00:13:05.755 --> 00:13:07.045
Are you okay?

00:13:10.325 --> 00:13:13.695
Why don't we be a family?

00:13:15.425 --> 00:13:16.955
The Paw Pad Squadron.

00:13:18.295 --> 00:13:19.855
I don't understand.

00:13:20.705 --> 00:13:22.605
No matter how worried you are...

00:13:22.665 --> 00:13:25.105
...a family would
stick together, right?

00:13:26.945 --> 00:13:28.495
Yeah, but that's...

00:13:29.675 --> 00:13:33.575
At the very least,
I know I won't run away.

00:13:34.285 --> 00:13:36.685
I trust you about that.

00:13:38.785 --> 00:13:39.875
Let's go back.

00:13:40.455 --> 00:13:41.515
Tabby?

00:13:42.325 --> 00:13:43.285
Huh?

00:13:43.525 --> 00:13:46.355
Would you like to meet once
in the real world?

00:13:48.895 --> 00:13:53.735
I think I can take your mind off
of your loneliness.

00:14:00.675 --> 00:14:02.905
By contacting me...

00:14:03.175 --> 00:14:05.615
...I take it that you want
to join our guild?

00:14:06.175 --> 00:14:07.335
Well...

00:14:07.715 --> 00:14:09.945
You haven't accepted
the truth yet?

00:14:10.985 --> 00:14:14.815
There's definitely
something strange about my PC.

00:14:14.885 --> 00:14:21.085
But the whole part about causing
trouble by involving others...

00:14:21.165 --> 00:14:23.125
I just can't imagine it.

00:14:23.335 --> 00:14:26.425
Are you saying my words
alone aren't enough to convince you?

00:14:26.935 --> 00:14:27.905
Well, yeah.

00:14:28.635 --> 00:14:29.605
Fine.

00:14:30.205 --> 00:14:31.325
Follow me.

00:14:36.975 --> 00:14:39.505
So, I'm playing the mom?

00:14:39.575 --> 00:14:41.305
It feels kind of weird.

00:14:41.515 --> 00:14:44.345
Well, you're the guild's
birth mother.

00:14:44.915 --> 00:14:48.255
But then, who's the dad?

00:14:48.555 --> 00:14:49.545
Well, you know.

00:14:49.625 --> 00:14:50.815
Who? Who?

00:14:54.195 --> 00:14:55.685
Um...

00:14:55.765 --> 00:14:56.785
Seisaku?

00:14:57.395 --> 00:14:58.485
Mr. Tohta!

00:15:24.995 --> 00:15:26.045
What the?

00:15:26.125 --> 00:15:29.425
It's the same phenomena
as the one that attacked you.

00:15:30.135 --> 00:15:31.825
What is that?

00:15:32.635 --> 00:15:33.725
A monster?

00:15:34.265 --> 00:15:38.495
They are bugs that have been
identified in The World.

00:15:39.075 --> 00:15:40.195
A bug?

00:15:40.475 --> 00:15:42.065
A very dangerous bug.

00:15:55.325 --> 00:15:57.795
So, is that what's in me?

00:15:58.325 --> 00:15:59.625
No.

00:15:59.695 --> 00:16:03.895
The thing that dwells in your
PC body is a very special power.

00:16:05.435 --> 00:16:07.055
A special power?

00:16:07.705 --> 00:16:08.825
Yes.

00:16:08.905 --> 00:16:12.265
It's a very dangerous power.

00:16:13.575 --> 00:16:14.875
Move away from me!

00:16:29.425 --> 00:16:33.455
I know the techniques
needed to control this power.

00:16:33.895 --> 00:16:36.695
But you don't know them.

00:16:37.795 --> 00:16:41.235
You should try to imagine
the effects of a power...

00:16:41.335 --> 00:16:43.025
...you can't control.

00:16:48.305 --> 00:16:49.935
I think it looks lame.

00:16:50.315 --> 00:16:51.505
Yeah.

00:16:51.875 --> 00:16:53.105
What?

00:16:54.315 --> 00:16:58.305
Okay, you guys should
follow Haseo around.

00:16:58.915 --> 00:17:00.185
Why Haseo?

00:17:01.025 --> 00:17:04.585
You guys are going to
revive the players that Haseo kills.

00:17:04.655 --> 00:17:07.355
And heal Haseo
when he's been hurt.

00:17:07.565 --> 00:17:10.865
Then whether you like it or not
you'll be the talk of the town.

00:17:11.165 --> 00:17:12.565
I get it!

00:17:12.695 --> 00:17:13.825
Let's do it!

00:17:54.445 --> 00:17:56.405
Did you take care of your errands?

00:17:57.245 --> 00:17:58.215
Yeah.

00:17:58.575 --> 00:18:00.915
Then can we go
somewhere again?

00:18:04.915 --> 00:18:06.115
Kuhn?

00:18:06.725 --> 00:18:08.315
Is something wrong?

00:18:09.355 --> 00:18:10.415
No.

00:18:10.795 --> 00:18:13.385
Is there anything
we can do?

00:18:13.465 --> 00:18:14.955
It's not that.

00:18:16.295 --> 00:18:17.285
I...

00:18:19.265 --> 00:18:22.035
I think I'm going to
leave this guild.

00:18:23.435 --> 00:18:24.495
Why?

00:18:25.805 --> 00:18:29.465
I'm really sorry to be
so selfish, but...

00:18:29.875 --> 00:18:31.635
I don't like that!

00:18:32.115 --> 00:18:33.635
I can't accept it.

00:18:34.585 --> 00:18:38.485
I might be involved
in something strange.

00:18:38.915 --> 00:18:39.945
That's why.

00:18:40.955 --> 00:18:43.145
What do you mean "strange"?

00:18:44.325 --> 00:18:47.085
I don't know
how to explain it.

00:18:47.965 --> 00:18:52.025
I'm not in line with the system,
or something like that.

00:18:52.495 --> 00:18:54.895
Anyway, I don't want to
involve you guys.

00:18:55.505 --> 00:18:58.995
And we can't do
anything about it?

00:19:00.175 --> 00:19:04.635
I know it's not cool to be leaving
a guild that I just started.

00:19:05.515 --> 00:19:07.375
But I hope
you can understand.

00:19:07.445 --> 00:19:08.475
No!

00:19:09.885 --> 00:19:12.715
I don't want to be in a guild
if you're not in it!

00:19:12.785 --> 00:19:15.085
I'm going to leave with you!

00:19:16.895 --> 00:19:17.945
Gaspard.

00:19:18.125 --> 00:19:19.755
Kuhn!

00:19:21.565 --> 00:19:23.965
Apparently it's dangerous
if you're with me.

00:19:25.465 --> 00:19:30.065
I just want you guys to be able
to play this game normally.

00:19:31.005 --> 00:19:33.135
I'm not convinced...

00:19:33.205 --> 00:19:35.865
...but I understand
what you're trying to say.

00:19:37.945 --> 00:19:39.035
I'm sorry.

00:19:48.085 --> 00:19:51.055
Can you take care of this guild?

00:19:52.825 --> 00:19:54.025
I'll manage.

00:19:54.495 --> 00:19:55.825
And I've got Gaspard.

00:19:56.595 --> 00:19:57.685
Gaspard...

00:19:59.735 --> 00:20:00.795
I'm sorry.

00:20:01.705 --> 00:20:02.995
Don't cry.

00:20:03.575 --> 00:20:05.005
Kuhn...

00:20:05.075 --> 00:20:08.005
You can come back
whenever you want, okay?

00:20:11.075 --> 00:20:12.045
Yeah.

00:20:29.965 --> 00:20:30.955
Repth!

00:20:33.265 --> 00:20:34.565
If you've been hurt...

00:20:34.805 --> 00:20:36.095
During battle...

00:20:36.635 --> 00:20:37.725
We'll heal you all!

